

#===-- uG24 toolchain ------------------------------------------------------===
# Build trees and installed toolchains: all reproducible from these sources.
#
# One pattern rather than a list of names.  The list was how 6,156 files of
# compiler-rt build output reached this repository in September 2026: it named
# build-ug24, build-stage1, build-arm64, build-armhf and build-none-eabi, so a
# blanket `git add` took build-rt-armhf and build-rt-m4, which matched nothing.
# A glob cannot have that gap.  Force-add with `git add -f` in the unlikely event
# a directory named build-* ever holds something worth versioning.
/build-*/
/stage1/
/toolchain-*/
/sysroot-*/

# Source-index databases, regenerated by cscope or ctags on demand.
/cscope.files
/cscope.in.out
/cscope.out
/cscope.po.out
/tags
/TAGS
/compile_commands.json

# Per-run output from compiling or simulating a test.
*.elf
*.dis
*.actual
ug24-memory.bin

# The simulator binary is built by ug24-setup.sh.
/ug24-sim/ug24sim

# Snapshot archives: the sources they hold are versioned here.
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Compiler output left beside the uG24 test sources.  Scoped to those
# directories: .s and .ll are ordinary test inputs everywhere else in LLVM.
/ug24-tests/**/*.s
/ug24-tests/**/*.ll
/ug24-tests/**/*.o
/ug24-sim/**/*.s
/ug24-sim/**/*.ll
/ug24-sim/**/*.o
!/ug24-runtime/crt0.s
ug24-handoff/
